0 -3.75233 TD
(For a more realistic example, since we can now use loops and perform row\ )Tj
0 -1.2 TD
(operations on a matrix, Gaussian Elimination can be performed using only\ two )Tj
T*
(loops and one statement: )Tj
/T1_1 1 Tf
0 -2.56195 TD
(>> for j=2:3,)Tj
0 -1.2 TD
(     for i=j:3,)Tj
T*
(        B\(i,:\) = B\(i,:\) - B\(j-1,:\)*B\(i,j-1\)/B\(j-1,j-1\))Tj
T*
(     end)Tj
T*
(   end)Tj
